18
00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:51.190
We're sisters, and as we were growing up,

19
00:00:51.190 --> 00:00:55.010
I had to take care of my brothers and sisters a lot.

20
00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:58.720
And one of our connections was you.

21
00:00:58.720 --> 00:01:00.880
We always had a little bit of a tough time

22
00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:02.050
